 margin and 0 8cm to the closest anterior margin  There is also and ill defined white firm mass  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm located in the right upper outer quadrant adjacent to the axillary tail  The mass is 0 4cm from the closest deep margin and abuts the anterior margin  The small axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  several of which are found ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE SECTION CODE  A  FX 1  section of firm area  B  Gritty area and closest anterior margins  right upper outer quadrant  C  gritty area  closest deep margin  right upper outer quadrant  D  gritty area adjacent to frozen section  deep margin right lower outer quadrant  E  gritty area  anterior margin  right lower outer quadrant  F  gritty area  deep margin  right lower outer quadrant  lateral most  G  mass from right upper outer quadrant  anterior margin  H  mass from right upper outer quadrant  posterior margin  I  fibrous tissue  J  uninvolved breast parenchyma  K N  Possible lymph nodes  Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  TWO SMALL NODULES   DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  NO DEFINITE INVASION IDENTIFIED  O R  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY , Mastectomy.
