en and a black stitch marking the true margin  The non stitched side appears to be a biopsy cavity  The biopsy cavity has a smooth surface with patchy firm yellow to white fibrous appearing tissue  There is also a focus of pigmented nodular tissue on the anterior surface of the biopsy cavity that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm thick  The true margin is inked black and the entire specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in cassettes B G  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast inferior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm fragment of fibrofatty tissue consistent with biopsy cavity site  There is a stitch marking the true margin which also appears to be consistent with the external surface of the biopsy cavity site  The external surface is unremarkable yellow adipose tissue with interspersed white fibrous tissue  The biopsy cavity site has a tan yellow firm interior with interspersed fibrous tissue  There is an attached skin ellipse that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm thick  The true margin and the skin resection margin are inked black  The entire specimen except for the skin ellipse is submitted in cassettes H Q  The entire skin ellipse is submitted in cassettes R and S  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast superior margin  is a piece of adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm  The true margin of the specimen is marked with a stitch  The stitched margin consists of yellow unremarkable adipose tissue with variegated white fibrous tissue dispersed through it  On the other side is the biopsy cavity site which appears tan yellow firm  patchy fibrous appearing material with interspersed white fibrous tissue  The true margin is inked black and the entire specimen is submitted in cassettes T Z  Resident  STEWART M  KNOEPP  MD   Ph D                                                            