TIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm mass of fibroadipose tissue  sectioned to reveal multiple lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE up 1 2cm  submitted in cassettes M through R  Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST INFERIOR SURFACE   FAATTY BREAST TISSUE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2   RIGHT BREAST SUPERIOR SURFACE   FATTY BREAST TISSUE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  Kathleen O Neil Smith  BUMS O R  Diagnosis by  Austin L  Vickery  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART A  RIGHT BREST LUMPECTOMY PART B  AXILLA  RIGHT    report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
