ED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm ill defined  fibrous  irregular tan white area located along the anterior aspect of the cavity wall  coming to 0 9cm from the skin surface  1 1cm and 1 2cm from the inferior and superior margins respectively  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is unremarkable fibrofatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A H as follows  A  Well delineated area along postero inferior cavity wall  B E  Representative sections of cavity wall  F  Uninvolved parenchyma  G H  Ill defined fibrous area along anterior aspect of wall  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node  are two irregular tan pink lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The lymph nodes are bisected to reveal a smooth homogenous tan pink cut surface  The larger node is entirely submitted in cassette J and the smaller in cassette I  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  axillary tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm of irregular tan pink to yellow portion of fibrofatty tissue  No lymph nodes are identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette K  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  NICOLE ANN BELSLEY  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  AXILLARY TISSUE  LEFT   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  SENTINEL   EXCISION , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
