e portions of skin  The specimen weighs 150 grams in aggregate  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable tan yellow to pink fibroadipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted are submitted in cassettes X GG  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  FCK                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  Brian Ian Labow  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE RIGHT AXILLA  740  EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE RIGHT AXILLA  200  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT  MAMMOPLASTY , Mastectomy.
