ame  unit number and with no designation as to site  are six cores of soft  tan tissue  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm which are submitted in toto as A  Gross Description by  Robert F Donnell Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Debra Monticciolo MD Susan E Briggs  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  CORE BIOPSIES , not_surgery.
