tive sections of superior posterior lesion  E  Representative section of cavity and surrounding firm areas in relation to superior and deep resection margins  F  Representative sections of cavity and surrounding firm lesions in relation to lateral resection margin  Labelled  final lateral margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fibrofatty tissue fragment with a stitch indicating the final lateral margin  The final lateral margin is inked black and the opposite surface is inked blue  Sectioning reveals adipose tissue with focal hemorrhagic areas approximately 0 4cm from the closest final resection margin  The final lateral margin is taken en face and submitted in toto in cassette G K  The remaining specimen is submitted in cassette L O  Labelled  left axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm adipose tissue  Sectioning reveals multiple tan rubbery lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm  The lymph nodes are bisected and REMOVED_DATE of each is submitted in cassettes P S  Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA  CONTENTS PART C  BREAST  LEFT FINAL LATERAL MARGIN   EXCISION   report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
